# FitForge Design System

## Colors (use hex directly or CSS var)
- Brand accent: `#C8FF00` (neon lime)
- Page bg: `#0F0F11`
- Card bg: `#17171A`
- Input/hover bg: `#1E1E23`
- Border: `#2A2A30`
- Text: `#F0F0F5` / Muted: `#7A7A8C` / Subtle: `#4A4A5A`
- Danger: `#FF4560` | Warning: `#FF9F0A` | Info: `#0A84FF` | Success: `#30D158`

## Typography
- Headings / stats / big numbers: `font-family: 'Barlow Condensed'`, `font-black`, uppercase
- Body: `DM Sans` (default)
- Never use Inter, Roboto, Arial, system-ui

## Stat number pattern
```tsx
<span className="text-4xl font-black text-[#C8FF00]"
  style={{ fontFamily: "'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif" }}>
  {value}
</span>
```

## Cards
```tsx
<Card className="p-5">           // standard card
<Card hover>                     // adds hover lift + border glow
<Card glow>                      // permanent brand glow shadow
```

## Buttons
```tsx
<Button variant="primary">      // #C8FF00 fill — main CTA
<Button variant="secondary">    // dark border — secondary actions
<Button variant="ghost">        // no bg — nav/icon buttons
<Button variant="danger">       // red tint — destructive
<Button variant="outline">      // lime border — alternative CTA
```

## Progress
```tsx
<ProgressBar value={0-100} color="#C8FF00" height={6} />
<CircularProgress value={0-100} size={80} strokeWidth={6} color="#C8FF00" />
```

## Spacing
- Page padding: `p-6`
- Section gaps: `space-y-6`
- Card border radius: `rounded-2xl` or `rounded-[16px]`
- Button radius: `rounded-xl` or `rounded-[10px]`
